    "to": "liang-zhu-youzhen-consort-guo",
    "kind": "conflict",
    "label": "入汴后召见",
    "note": "郭氏因惧听命；不增写未载具体行为或自行请求出家。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "chapterId": "new-v13",
        "paragraphId": "new-v13-p20",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "2b96ffabc368ac3a5761313bd2bc88d41df2efaf1692a3f4d727a21dc2f764f0",
        "excerpt": "賀王友雍妃石氏有色，莊宗召之，石氏慢罵，莊宗殺之。次以召妃，妃懼而聽命。",
        "title": "《新五代史》 · 卷 13 · 梁家人传（含朱友珪）"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "youyong-shi-marriage",
    "from": "zhu-youyong",
    "to": "liang-zhu-youyong-wife-shi",
    "kind": "kinship",
    "label": "贺王与妃",
    "note": "石氏是朱友雍之妃，与末帝两妃身份分开。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "chapterId": "new-v13",
        "paragraphId": "new-v13-p20",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "2b96ffabc368ac3a5761313bd2bc88d41df2efaf1692a3f4d727a21dc2f764f0",
        "excerpt": "賀王友雍妃石氏有色，莊宗召之，石氏慢罵，莊宗殺之。",
        "title": "《新五代史》 · 卷 13 · 梁家人传（含朱友珪）"
      }
    ]
  },
