        "title": "《新五代史》 · 卷 13 · 梁家人传（含朱友珪）"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "youzhen-shouchun-daughter",
    "from": "zhu-youzhen",
    "to": "liang-zhu-youzhen-princess-shouchun",
    "kind": "kinship",
    "label": "父女",
    "note": "史称少帝长女；母系未载。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "chapterId": "huiyao-v002",
        "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p17",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "3b2825fddd0a90bbd60e4a3f9e07fbc380d540feafd1f2bded0dd80732963d7e",
